{"status":"ready","content":"[Thinking]\n**Writing CSGO website HTML**\n\nThe user has asked for complete HTML for a CSGO website, but that’s a bit ambiguous. They might want a static template, so I should create a single HTML file that includes CSS and possibly some JavaScript. I need to avoid copyrighted content while keeping a reasonable length, so I’ll include sections like header, hero, features, weapons, maps, news, community, and footer. I’ll also ensure it’s responsive, use placeholder images, and add comments throughout. Let’s get started on this complete HTML5 page!\n[/Thinking]\n\nBelow is a complete, self-contained HTML file you can save as something like \"index.html\". It’s a responsive, modern single-page template for a CS:GO themed website with sections for hero, features, maps, weapons, news, community, and a footer. It includes inline CSS and small JavaScript for navigation and simple interactions. Replace placeholder images, text, and links with your real content.\n\nSave this as index.html and open in a browser:\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>CSGO Hub — News, Maps, Weapons & Community</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"CSGO Hub — community-driven CS:GO website for news, maps, weapon guides, and esports coverage.\" />\n  <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Your Name or Organization\" />\n  <style>\n    /* Reset-ish */\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html,body { height:100%; margin:0; font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial; background:#0b0f13; color:#e6eef8; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale; }\n    a { color: #7fd3ff; text-decoration:none; }\n    img { max-width:100%; display:block; }\n    /* Layout */\n    .container { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:24px; }\n    header { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding:12px 0; }\n    .brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; }\n    .logo { width:48px; height:48px; background:#1b2330; border-radius:6px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:700; color:#7fd3ff; font-size:18px; }\n    nav { display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }\n    .btn { background:#1e2933; color:#d7efff; padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid rgba(127,211,255,0.06); cursor:pointer; }\n    .btn.secondary { background: transparent; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color:#cfefff; }\n    .hero { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px; gap:28px; align-items:center; padding:36px 0; }\n    .hero .title { font-size:32px; line-height:1.05; margin:0 0 12px 0; color:#dff6ff; }\n    .hero p { margin:0 0 18px 0; color:#bfefff; opacity:0.95; }\n    .cta-row { display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }\n    .card { background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(0,0,0,0.12)); border-radius:12px; padding:18px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }\n    .small-card { display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; }\n    .stat { font-size:20px; font-weight:700; color:#a7f0ff; }\n    /* Sections */\n    section { padding:28px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }\n    h2 { margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:20px; color:#dff6ff; }\n    .grid { display:grid; gap:16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); }\n    .map-item, .weapon-item, .news-item { background:#0f1620; padding:14px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }\n    .map-thumb { height:120px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#14202a,#0b1116); border-radius:8px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#8ccff6; font-weight:700; }\n    .weapon-item .name { font-weight:700; color:#cfefff; }\n    .tags { display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:8px; }\n    .tag { background:rgba(127,211,255,0.08); color:#bfefff; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:999px; font-size:12px; }\n    /* Footer */\n    footer { padding:18px 0 48px; color:#9fbfd1; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03); margin-top:24px; }\n    .socials { display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; }\n    /* Responsive */\n    @media (max-width:920px) {\n      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      nav { display:none; }\n      header { align-items:flex-start; }\n      .nav-toggle { display:inline-flex; }\n    }\n    @media (min-width:921px) {\n      .nav-toggle { display:none; }\n    }\n    /* small interactions */\n    .hidden { display:none; }\n    .chip { display:inline-flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#11161b; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }\n    .news-item time { font-size:12px; color:#90cfe9; }\n    .muted { color:#93b6c8; font-size:14px; }\n    /* simple focus */\n    a:focus, button:focus { outline:2px solid rgba(127,211,255,0.16); outline-offset:2px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <div class=\"logo\" aria-hidden=\"true\">CS</div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#cff6ff;\">CSGO Hub</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#8fbcd0;\">News • Guides • Community</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <nav id=\"mainNav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n        <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#news\">News</a>\n        <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#maps\">Maps</a>\n        <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#weapons\">Weapons</a>\n        <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#community\">Community</a>\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#download\">Download</a>\n      </nav>\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center;\">\n        <button class=\"btn nav-toggle\" id=\"navToggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobileNav\">Menu</button>\n        <button class=\"btn\" id=\"themeToggle\" title=\"Toggle theme\">Theme</button>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div id=\"mobileNav\" class=\"hidden\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#news\">News</a>\n        <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#maps\">Maps</a>\n        <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#weapons\">Weapons</a>\n        <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#community\">Community</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- HERO -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n      <div>\n        <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"title\">CS:GO Hub — Strategies, Updates, and Community</h1>\n        <p>Sharpen your aim, learn the maps, and stay up to date with the latest patches and esports coverage. Guides, weapon stats, map callouts, and a friendly community.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta-row\">\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#maps\">Explore Maps</a>\n          <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#weapons\">Weapon Guides</a>\n          <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"#news\">Latest News</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; margin-top:18px; align-items:center;\">\n          <div class=\"chip\">\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"opacity:0.9\">\n              <path d=\"M12 2v20M2 12h20\" stroke=\"#7fd3ff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div style=\"font-size:13px;\">Beginner-friendly guides</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"chip\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;\">Esports highlights</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <aside>\n        <div class=\"card small-card\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#98cfe6;\">Active users</div>\n            <div class=\"stat\" id=\"activeUsers\">1,245</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#96cde3;\">Online right now</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"width:80px; text-align:center;\">\n            <div style=\"background:#0c1620; width:64px; height:64px; border-radius:999px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#7fd3ff; font-weight:700;\">A</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"height:12px;\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"card\" id=\"quickNews\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#9ecfe8; margin-bottom:8px;\">Patch Note</div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#dff6ff; margin-bottom:6px;\">Update 2.40 — Recoil adjustments</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#88cfe0;\">New recoil tuning on rifles. Click to read full notes.</div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px; text-align:right;\"><a href=\"#news\">Read more →</a></div>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- NEWS -->\n    <section id=\"news\" aria-labelledby=\"news-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"news-title\">Latest News</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        <article class=\"news-item card\" aria-labelledby=\"n1\">\n          <div class=\"muted\" style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\">\n            <time datetime=\"2026-05-01\">May 1, 2026</time>\n            <div class=\"tag\">Patch</div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 id=\"n1\" style=\"margin:8px 0 6px 0; color:#dff6ff;\">Major balance patch adjusts rifles and pistols</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Overview of weapon adjustments, economy tweaks, and bug fixes. Competitive meta expected to shift.</p>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Read article</a></div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"news-item card\" aria-labelledby=\"n2\">\n          <div class=\"muted\" style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\">\n            <time datetime=\"2026-04-24\">Apr 24, 2026</time>\n            <div class=\"tag\">Esports</div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 id=\"n2\" style=\"margin:8px 0 6px 0; color:#dff6ff;\">Championship Finals: Recap & Highlights</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">A breakdown of the final series, standout plays, and MVP performance.</p>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Read recap</a></div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"news-item card\" aria-labelledby=\"n3\">\n          <div class=\"muted\" style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\">\n            <time datetime=\"2026-04-15\">Apr 15, 2026</time>\n            <div class=\"tag\">Guide</div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 id=\"n3\" style=\"margin:8px 0 6px 0; color:#dff6ff;\">Beginners: How to learn crosshair placement</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Simple routines and drills to improve crosshair placement and reduce deaths.</p>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Start learning</a></div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAPS -->\n    <section id=\"maps\" aria-labelledby=\"maps-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"maps-title\">Maps & Callouts</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">Explore overview, common smoke lines, and key angles for every competitive map.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        <div class=\"map-item card\">\n          <div class=\"map-thumb\">Dust2</div>\n          <h3 style=\"margin:12px 0 6px 0; color:#dff6ff;\">Dust II</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Classic, balanced map. Focus on mid control and fast rotations.</p>\n          <div class=\"tags\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <div class=\"tag\">CT-sided</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\">Beginner-friendly</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">View callouts</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"map-item card\">\n          <div class=\"map-thumb\">Mirage</div>\n          <h3 style=\"margin:12px 0 6px 0; color:#dff6ff;\">Mirage</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Versatile map with many execute options. Timing and utility are key.</p>\n          <div class=\"tags\">\n            <div class=\"tag\">Tactics</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\">Smoke lines</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">View callouts</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"map-item card\">\n          <div class=\"map-thumb\">Inferno</div>\n          <h3 style=\"margin:12px 0 6px 0; color:#dff6ff;\">Inferno</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Strong utility map, banana control is crucial for CTs.</p>\n          <div class=\"tags\">\n            <div class=\"tag\">Utility</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\">Rotations</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">View callouts</a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- WEAPONS -->\n    <section id=\"weapons\" aria-labelledby=\"weapons-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"weapons-title\">Weapons & Stats</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">Quick look at popular weapons, recoil patterns, and recommended situations.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        <div class=\"weapon-item card\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; gap:12px;\">\n            <div style=\"width:86px; height:54px; background:#071018; border-radius:6px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#9edfff; font-weight:700;\">AK</div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"name\">AK-47</div>\n              <div class=\"muted\">One-shot headshot on T side, high damage, strong spray pattern.</div>\n              <div class=\"tags\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><div class=\"tag\">Rifle</div><div class=\"tag\">Entry</div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px; text-align:right;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Guide</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"weapon-item card\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; gap:12px;\">\n            <div style=\"width:86px; height:54px; background:#071018; border-radius:6px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#9edfff; font-weight:700;\">M4</div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"name\">M4A4 / M4A1-S</div>\n              <div class=\"muted\">CT rifles with lower damage but more manageable spray and accuracy.</div>\n              <div class=\"tags\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><div class=\"tag\">Rifle</div><div class=\"tag\">Utility</div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px; text-align:right;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Guide</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"weapon-item card\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; gap:12px;\">\n            <div style=\"width:86px; height:54px; background:#071018; border-radius:6px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#9edfff; font-weight:700;\">AWP</div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"name\">AWP</div>\n              <div class=\"muted\">High risk/reward sniper. One-shot body -> lethal, but slow movement.</div>\n              <div class=\"tags\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><div class=\"tag\">Sniper</div><div class=\"tag\">Positioning</div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px; text-align:right;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Guide</a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- COMMUNITY -->\n    <section id=\"community\" aria-labelledby=\"community-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"community-title\">Community & Events</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">Join the forum, find local pickup games, and check upcoming tournaments.</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n        <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1; min-width:260px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#dff6ff;\">Forums</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Ask questions, share demos, and discuss tactics with other players.</p>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Visit forums</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1; min-width:260px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#dff6ff;\">Tournaments</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Upcoming community tournaments and signups. Compete and win prizes.</p>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">View events</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1; min-width:260px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#dff6ff;\">Servers</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Find practice and deathmatch servers to warm up and test strategies.</p>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Server list</a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; align-items:center;\">\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#cff6ff;\">CSGO Hub</div>\n          <div class=\"muted\">© 2026 CSGO Hub — All rights reserved</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"socials\">\n          <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Discord\" class=\"muted\">Discord</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Twitter\" class=\"muted\">Twitter</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"YouTube\" class=\"muted\">YouTube</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    // Mobile nav toggle\n    (function(){\n      const btn = document.getElementById('navToggle');\n      const mobile = document.getElementById('mobileNav');\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const open = mobile.classList.toggle('hidden');\n        // aria-exp should be true when menu visible\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', !open);\n      });\n    })();\n\n    // Theme toggle (light/dark) - basic\n    (function(){\n      const btn = document.getElementById('themeToggle');\n      let dark = true;\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        dark = !dark;\n        if (!dark) {\n          document.documentElement.style.background = '#fbfcfe","metadata":{"modelLabel":"GPT-5 Mini","modelId":"openai/gpt-5-mini","promptId":"553-lmsys-chat-1m-Write-The-Complete-Html-For-A-Csgo-Website","content":"[Thinking]\n**Writing CSGO website HTML**\n\nThe user has asked for complete HTML for a CSGO website, but that’s a bit ambiguous. They might want a static template, so I should create a single HTML file that includes CSS and possibly some JavaScript. I need to avoid copyrighted content while keeping a reasonable length, so I’ll include sections like header, hero, features, weapons, maps, news, community, and footer. I’ll also ensure it’s responsive, use placeholder images, and add comments throughout. Let’s get started on this complete HTML5 page!\n[/Thinking]\n\nBelow is a complete, self-contained HTML file you can save as something like \"index.html\". It’s a responsive, modern single-page template for a CS:GO themed website with sections for hero, features, maps, weapons, news, community, and a footer. It includes inline CSS and small JavaScript for navigation and simple interactions. Replace placeholder images, text, and links with your real content.\n\nSave this as index.html and open in a browser:\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>CSGO Hub — News, Maps, Weapons & Community</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"CSGO Hub — community-driven CS:GO website for news, maps, weapon guides, and esports coverage.\" />\n  <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Your Name or Organization\" />\n  <style>\n    /* Reset-ish */\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: 